{
  "title": { "zh": "找视差" },
  "after": {
    "zh": "形状只在「匹配」里出现：每张图单看都只是杂点。对应点只需在同一行里找，视差越大，物体越近。"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "伸出一根手指放在眼前，轮流闭上左眼和右眼：手指和远处的墙，哪个跳得更厉害？同一样东西在两只眼里错开的距离，叫<b>视差</b>。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "机器人和汽车上的双目相机也靠视差判断远近。这一关的两张图都是随机噪点，单看哪张都没有形状；心理学家 Julesz 在 1960 年用这种图证明，人不认出任何物体也能看出立体。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新原件<part-ref to=\"part:argmin4\"></part-ref>接四张图，逐格看哪一张最小，输出它的编号 0–3。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "输出是一张视差图：每格填 0 到 3，表示那里的东西在两张图之间错开了几格，少数格子出错可以接受。要想的是：怎样判断右图的某一格和左图的这一格是同一处？"
      },
      "fig": { "test": 0, "caption": { "zh": "左图、右图 → 每格的视差" } }
    }
  ],
  "adds": ["argmin4"],
  "tray": "geometry",
  "unlocks": ["disparity"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "7-1",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "左右两台相机拍同一个场景。输出每个像素的视差 d（0 … 3）：右图里同一个点比左图往左挪了几格。"
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "对每个可能的 d，把右图挪一挪再和左图比。单个像素比不准时，看看它周围。"
      },
      "inputs": ["left", "right"],
      "inputLabels": { "left": { "zh": "左相机" }, "right": { "zh": "右相机" } },
      "views": { "out": "terrain" },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.1, "mismatches": 34 },
      "scene": "stereo",
      "tests": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "第 1 对" },
          "seed": 11,
          "layers": [{ "box": [5, 4, 11, 12], "d": 2 }],
          "noise": 0.1
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "第 2 对" },
          "seed": 12,
          "layers": [{ "box": [5, 4, 11, 12], "d": 2 }],
          "noise": 0.1
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "第 3 对" },
          "seed": 13,
          "layers": [{ "box": [5, 4, 11, 12], "d": 2 }],
          "noise": 0.1
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "远一点的块" },
          "seed": 14,
          "layers": [{ "box": [3, 3, 10, 10], "d": 1 }],
          "noise": 0.1
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "近一点的块" },
          "seed": 15,
          "layers": [{ "box": [6, 7, 13, 14], "d": 3 }],
          "noise": 0.1
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "e0 = arith[op=sub](left, right)",
        "r10 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "r20 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "r30 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "q0 = arith[op=mul](e0, e0)",
        "e1 = arith[op=sub](left, r10)",
        "r21 = shift[dir=right](r20)",
        "r31 = shift[dir=right](r30)",
        "b0 = box3(q0)",
        "q1 = arith[op=mul](e1, e1)",
        "e2 = arith[op=sub](left, r21)",
        "r32 = shift[dir=right](r31)",
        "b1 = box3(q1)",
        "q2 = arith[op=mul](e2, e2)",
        "e3 = arith[op=sub](left, r32)",
        "b2 = box3(q2)",
        "q3 = arith[op=mul](e3, e3)",
        "b3 = box3(q3)",
        "argmin = argmin4(b0, b1, b2, b3)",
        "out <- argmin"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "e0 = arith[op=sub](left, right)",
        "r10 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "r20 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "r30 = shift[dir=right](right)",
        "q0 = arith[op=mul](e0, e0)",
        "e1 = arith[op=sub](left, r10)",
        "r21 = shift[dir=right](r20)",
        "r31 = shift[dir=right](r30)",
        "q1 = arith[op=mul](e1, e1)",
        "e2 = arith[op=sub](left, r21)",
        "r32 = shift[dir=right](r31)",
        "q2 = arith[op=mul](e2, e2)",
        "e3 = arith[op=sub](left, r32)",
        "q3 = arith[op=mul](e3, e3)",
        "argmin = argmin4(q0, q1, q2, q3)",
        "out <- argmin"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
